# DESIGN.md — Project Design System Specification

> Starter OpenDesign specification generated by `agy-opendesign`.
> Customize the tokens, typography, and component rules below to match your product domain, or seed them from an OpenDesign reference system via MCP (`read_resource` on `od://design-systems/<id>/DESIGN.md`).

## 1. Visual Theme & Philosophy

- **Product Personality**: Calm, high-clarity, craft-focused interface — content comes first, chrome recedes.
- **Core Principle**: One primary accent, warm/neutral paper surfaces, deliberate typographic hierarchy, zero visual clutter.
- **Thin-Adapter Boundary**: Keep structural redesign components under `components/redesign/` and define all raw palette values exclusively in your token stylesheet (`tokens.css` / `tokens.scss`).

## 2. Color Tokens (WCAG 2.2 AA)

Define all raw hex values only in your token stylesheet (`:root`):

```css
:root {
  /* Surfaces */
  --bg: #f8f7f4;
  --surface: #ffffff;
  --surface-subtle: #efede8;
  --surface-dark: #181a1b;

  /* Foreground Ink */
  --fg: #1c1f22;
  --fg-secondary: #3f464d;
  --muted: #5a636c;
  --fg-inverse: #f8f7f4;

  /* Borders */
  --border: #d8d5ce;
  --border-soft: #e8e5de;

  /* Brand Accent (>= 4.5:1 with white text) */
  --accent: #b84d39;
  --accent-hover: #9f3f2d;
  --accent-soft: #f6e7e3;
  --accent-on: #ffffff;

  /* Semantic States */
  --success: #1f6f4a;
  --success-soft: #e6f3ec;
  --warn: #9a5b13;
  --warn-soft: #fbf0df;
  --danger: #b42318;
  --danger-soft: #fdecec;
}
```

## 3. Typography & Scale

- **Display / Headings**: Distinct editorial serif or crisp geometric sans; never mix > 2 font families.
- **Body**: System UI sans stack with generous line height (`1.55–1.65`).
- **CJK Rules**: Set multi-line CJK heading `line-height: 1.3–1.4` and `letter-spacing: 0` (avoid tight negative Latin tracking).
- **Numeric Alignment**: Apply `font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums` to counters, timestamps, prices, and progress ratios.

## 4. Layout, Spacing & Elevation

- **Spacing Scale**: `4px`, `8px`, `12px`, `16px`, `24px`, `32px`, `48px`.
- **Touch Floor**: Interactive controls must maintain a minimum `44px x 44px` hit target.
- **Elevation**: Prefer crisp `1px` hairlines (`--border-soft`) and subtle ambient shadows over heavy drop shadows.
- **Glass & Motion Fallbacks**: Pair `backdrop-filter` with an opaque solid fallback via `@supports not (backdrop-filter: blur(1px))` and respect `@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)`.

## 5. Component Primitives

- Converge buttons onto a small predictable set (`.btn--primary`, `.btn--secondary`, `.btn--text`, `.btn--icon`, `.btn--danger`) with explicit `:focus-visible` outlines.
- Keep dialogs, drawers, and empty states honest and scannable across Loading, Empty, Error, Populated, and Edge states.

## 6. Anti-AI-Slop & Quality Gates

- **P0 Bans** (enforced by `node scripts/od-sync-audit.mjs --strict`):
  - Zero generic AI indigo/violet accents (`#6366f1`, `#4f46e5`, `#4338ca`, `#8b5cf6`, `#7c3aed`).
  - Zero unguarded `color-mix()` (use pre-blended solid tokens or wrap in `@supports`).
  - Zero rounded cards decorated with thick colored `border-left` accent bars.
- **P1 Hygiene**:
  - Zero raw hex literals outside the token stylesheet.
  - Zero `!important` specificity wars.
- **Five-Dimensional Critique Gate**: Score `>= 4/5` across Brand & Philosophy, Visual Hierarchy & Craft, Execution & Restraint, Accessibility & Responsiveness, and Copy Specificity before shipping.
